   "page_idx": 1,
   "bbox": [
    99.0,
    198.0,
    396.0,
    303.0
   ],
   "text": "Which equation represents line ℓ? A. $y = x + 1$ B. $y = 1 / 2 x + 2$ C. $y = 2 x + 1$ D. $y = - x + 1$"
